    "reviewedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "notes": "Approved project-authored low-poly rider and full-suspension 29er e-bike asset. Public Pole Voima K2 dimensions and service packaging inform wheelbase, chainstay, head angle, suspension travel, deep battery/down-tube mass, compact mid-drive envelope and long linked swingarm only. All angular frame, motor, linkage, fork, hub, rotor and spoke surfaces are generic authored silhouettes; no Pole model surfaces, logos, CAD or textures are copied. Runtime poses are snapshot-driven and intentionally use no baked GLB animation or root motion."
